From bf94258782448b31616922c0f7ac883cda773556 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maintainer <maintainer@camcraft.dev>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:33:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tools,app): add copper workpiece material

Add WorkMaterial::Copper (C11000 ETP / C10100 OFHC, ISO 513 group N,
word "copper", label "Copper (C11000)") at the end of WorkMaterial,
WorkMaterial::ALL, TABLE, and TURN_TABLE.

Add conservative milling and turning cutting-data rows for Copper,
update the camcraft-tools CLI usage, MCP set_work_material and
add_tool descriptions, MCP tool reference, and camcraft-mcp skill,
record the design decision in docs/decisions/3262-copper-workpiece-material.md,
and add unit, app, MCP, project round-trip, and UI pinning tests.

Fixes #3262
